                "children" : [ {
                  "attributes" : {
                    "dxpStyle" : { },
                    "richTextValue" : "<div class=\"two-thirds order-2\">\n            <h3>Learn Weave\n                <!-- <img src={underlineImg} alt=\"underline\" class=\"squiggle\"> -->\n            </h3>\n            <div class=\"d-m-b learn-weave\">\n                <div class=\"one-third\">\n                    <img src=\"/weavehelp/webruntime/org-asset/39f1cd3d64/resource/081WH0000001k5l/Weave_Training_Camp_Icon.png\" alt=\"training camp\" class=\"\" height=\"60\" width=\"auto\">\n                    <h5><a href=\"https://trainingcamp.weavehelp.com/\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"\">Weave Training Camp</a></h5>\n                    <p>From basic Weave setup to pro-tips—get hands-on Weave training for everyone.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"one-third\">\n                    <img src=\"/weavehelp/webruntime/org-asset/39f1cd3d64/resource/081WH0000001k5l/Monthly_Training_Workshop_Icon.png\" alt=\"weave labs\" class=\"\" height=\"60\" width=\"auto\">\n                    <h5><a href=\"https://trainingcamp.weavehelp.com/page/live-sessions\"  target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"\">Monthly Training Workshop</a></h5>\n                    <p>45 minute live and pre-recorded webinars to expand your Weave knowledge.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"one-third last-element\">\n                    <img src=\"/weavehelp/webruntime/org-asset/39f1cd3d64/resource/081WH0000001k5l/Weave_Live_Training_Icon.png\" alt=\"live training\" class=\"\" height=\"60\" width=\"auto\">\n                    <h5><a href=\"/article/sign-up-for-a-live-training-session\"  target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"\">Weave Live Training</a></h5>\n                    <p>Register for live, one-on-one Weave training sessions with our training team.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n</div>"
